Rebrand the desktop app so it installs and runs beside the official one and does not present as DeepSeek's product: product, executable, installer and artifact names, package name (own userData folder, single-instance lock and updater cache), protocol label, every product-name string in the shell, installer and web title, and the sidebar build label. Values come from brand.json.

